From c2e18db6169f28938b99c828b53e91d251a6fd91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "mujiburrahimank@maxlinear.com"
 <mujiburrahimank@lvdocker7.lvsw.maxlinear.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Oct 2025 23:57:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] WLANRTSYS-95568 : Addition of MXL vendor flag for MXL based
 commit

This commit ensures the MXL changes in the opensource files will be
under CONFIG_VENDOR_MXL flag. Since there are lot of commit which
deosn't follow this methodology, this commit has taken care of adding
Vendor flags for the MXL changes that are made in opensource files.

Ex: In a opensource file src/ap/hostapd.c

"#ifdef CONFIG_VENDOR_MXL"
"<MXL-BASED-CHANGES>"
"#else /* CONFIG_VENDOR_MXL */"
"<OPENSOURCE-CHANGES>"
"#endif /* CONFIG_VENDOR_MXL */"

Also if we need to exclude opensource changes we have used

"#ifndef CONFIG_VENDOR_MXL"
"<OPENSOURCE-CHANGES>"
"#endif /* CONFIG_VENDOR_MXL */"

So that we have not removed any opensource files and kept our changes
seperate from opensource
